# Elaam - Islamic Religious Management System

## 📋 Project Overview

**Project Name:** Elaam  
**Type:** Web Application (SPA - Single Page Application)  
**Description:** A comprehensive Islamic religious management system for community management, tracking Niyat (intentions), Khidmat Ramadaniyah (Ramadan services), Quran Hifz, and various other Islamic religious activities.

