## 🏗 Architecture

### Design Patterns
- **Lazy Loading** - Modules loaded on demand
- **Role-based Guards** - Route protection
- **HTTP Interceptors** - Token management & error handling
- **Service-based Architecture** - Centralized business logic
- **Component-based UI** - Reusable components

### Project Structure
```
src/app/
├── auth/                    # Authentication module
│   ├── components/          # Login component
│   ├── guard/              # Route guards
│   ├── interceptor/        # HTTP interceptors
│   └── service/            # Auth services
├── layout/                  # Main layout module
│   ├── content-layout/     # Content wrapper
│   └── modules/           # Feature modules
│       ├── dashboard/
│       ├── niyat-approve/
│       ├── khidmat-ramadaniyah/
│       ├── mumin-dashboard/
│       ├── catalogue/
│       ├── quran-hifz/
│       └── ... (other modules)
└── shared/                 # Shared components/services
```

